Z||000005||StuGood||03-07-2001||03:33 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ChadMan:<BR><B>...and the only emissions will be helium and water!...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I don't know how you get helium by burning hydrogen...  but it's a noble thought.<P>Energy density is such that you'd need to work the fuel storage problem pretty hard, to get decent range.  Tanks a lot  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.    <BR>||||reg||5
